        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><seg source="#source-8591-8600">その</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-8600-8624"><rb>老臣</rb><rt>ろうしん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-8624-8630">は、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-8630-8648"><rb>謹</rb><rt>つつし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-8648-8654">んで</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-8654-8675"><rb>天子</rb><rt>てんし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-8675-8684">さまの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-8684-8699"><rb>命</rb><rt>めい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-8699-8702">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-8702-8717"><rb>奉</rb><rt>ほう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-8717-8726">じて、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-8726-8747"><rb>御前</rb><rt>ごぜん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-8747-8762">をさがり、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-8762-8783"><rb>妻子</rb><rt>さいし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-8783-8786">・</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-8786-8810"><rb>親族</rb><rt>しんぞく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-8810-8813">・</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-8813-8837"><rb>友人</rb><rt>ゆうじん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-8837-8843">らに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-8843-8858"><rb>別</rb><rt>わか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-8858-8864">れを</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-8864-8876"><rb>告</rb><rt>つ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-8876-8885">げて、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-8885-8900"><rb>船</rb><rt>ふね</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-8900-8903">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-8903-8915"><rb>乗</rb><rt>の</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-8915-8924">って、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-8924-8942"><rb>東</rb><rt>ひがし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-8942-8945">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-8945-895